            <ArticleTitle>Pd-Catalyzed oxidative annulation of enamides with diazabicyclic olefins: rapid access to cyclopentene fused 2-pyrrolines.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1848-1851</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c6cc08753a</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An efficient stereoselective route for the synthesis of cyclopentene fused 2-pyrrolines has been established via a Pd-catalyzed C-H activation/oxidative coupling of aryl enamides with diazabicyclic olefins. The proposed two-stage mechanism was successfully proven by isolating the intermediate trans-disubstituted cyclopentene.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
